Z||000015||Mach10||06-23-2001||03:16 PM||||Looks more like a coprolith   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>Actually, that might be. It's too elongated to be avian, IMHO.<P>Take it to your friendly neighborhood university/museum. They'll know.<P>I wouldn't think that you *have* to turn it in, unless you got it from a park that has such rules. It *IS* just a rock, after all  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P><p>[This message has been edited by Mach10 (edited 06-23-2001).]||||reg||6
